  "title": "Palindrome Partitioning II",
  "summary": "For a string s, divide s into substrings where each is a palindrome.",
  "statement": "For a string s, divide s into substrings where each is a palindrome. Return the least number of cuts required for this partitioning.",
  "constraints": [
    "1–2000 lowercase English letters.",
    "Partition the complete string into nonempty contiguous palindromes and return the minimum number of cuts, not the number of pieces. A whole-string palindrome needs zero cuts."
